retroarch (1.18.0-1) mantic; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release: v1.18.0
  * Add retroarch-dev package for libretro-common headers and designate as
    Multi-Arch: foreign (Closes: #1027741)
  * Drop manual DEB_HOST_MULTIARCH substitutions for functionality available in
    debhelper compat level 13
  * Install upstream Appstream metainfo file with .metainfo.xml file extension,
    instead of deprecated .appdata.xml convention
  * Clean ephemeral Wayland files generated at build-time (Closes: #1045150)
  * Enable building against system spirv-cross (Closes: #1053190)

 -- Peter J. Mello <admin@petermello.net>  Thu, 21 Mar 2024 08:10:35 -0700

